  "description": "Having worked at these major shipyards and as Navy Officer, here are some keen insights",
  "body_html": "<p>If you don’t know me, I was a Naval Officer for several years…then worked at the Pentagon in the Navy Program Office…and then went to Bath Iron Works and Huntington Ingalls Industries, which are some of the largest Naval Shipbuilding facilities in the United States. The point being: I have a firm grasp on the naval defense sector. </p><p>Last week (31 July), HII popped up on the StockTok screener. I wasn’t exactly sure why….but the signals are usually pretty decent. Fast forward to today and I think the reason is because HII is the most likely candidate that will be <a href=\"https://www.navylookout.com/us-navy-demands-uncrewed-warships-delivered-in-18-months/\">able to meet the demand for rapid construction of uncrewed warships.</a> </p><p>A little context before we continue. Your top 8 largest U.S. Navy Shipbuilders are:</p><ol><li><p>Huntington Ingalls (HII); Specialties: carriers, submarines, amphibious assault ships and destroyers</p></li><li><p>General Dynamics Electric Boat; Specialties: Nuclear submarines</p></li><li><p>General Dynamics Bath Iron Works (BIW); Specialties: Destroyers and Zumwalt class destroyers</p></li><li><p>Austal USA; Specialties: Littoral Combat Ship and Expeditionary Fast Transport</p></li><li><p>Fincantieri Marinette Marine; Specialties: Littoral Combat Ship and Constellation Frigates</p></li><li><p>BAE System Ship Repair; Specialties: Ship repair and modernization</p></li><li><p>Bollinger Shipyards; Specialties: Fast response cutters, small support vessels in Navy</p></li><li><p>Halter Marine; Specialties: Auxiliary ships</p></li></ol><p>Though there are no guarantees, we can pretty much automatically eliminate BAE System Ship repair, Bollinger Shipyards, and Halter Marine. These shipyards do not have the personnel or the physical capacity to meet “urgent demand” or “rapid construction”. We can also likely removed General Dynamics Electric Boat since they focus on submarines. That leaves us with HII, BIW, Austal and Fincantieri. </p><p>Now <em><strong>Bath Iron Works, in comparison to say HII, is very small</strong></em>. You can compare the two shipyards, and the physical docking space, compared to HII is tiny. Both shipyards do have alternative docking…but again, nothing compared to HII. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WYC5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd3215210-c6df-4920-9d52-ceb132537061_1600x900.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WYC5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd3215210-c6df-4920-9d52-ceb132537061_1600x900.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WYC5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd3215210-c6df-4920-9d52-ceb132537061_1600x900.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WYC5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd3215210-c6df-4920-9d52-ceb132537061_1600x900.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WYC5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd3215210-c6df-4920-9d52-ceb132537061_1600x900.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WYC5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd3215210-c6df-4920-9d52-ceb132537061_1600x900.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/p